```wireframe
board "Files" layout=row
  screen desktop
    navbar "Files" leading=menu
    stack grow padding=16
      text "My Files" bold
      table columns=[Name, Type, Size, Modified] rows=8
    drawer right "Details" size=280
      stack gap=16 padding=16
        text "document.pdf" bold
        heading "Properties" level=3
        stack gap=8
          text "Type: PDF" muted size=sm
          text "Size: 2.4 MB" muted size=sm
          text "Modified: Oct 1, 2024" muted size=sm
        button secondary "Download" fullWidth
        button ghost "Share" fullWidth
```
